  data: {
    LLM: 'Prioritise winning the 7 of coins (sette bello); avoid giving away sweeps; leave at least 11 on the table when you cannot sweep to make it harder for the next player.\n\nEstablish anchors (e.g. a rank only your side can match) to set up whirlwinds; lead or leave cards of ranks you hold two or more of; track paired vs unpaired cards to plan the last trick.\n\nPair and unpair sevens to control the prime; coordinate with partner (e.g. play same rank after partner to consolidate); leave totals that the next player cannot match to force a card to the table for your side to capture.',
    Player: 'Prioritise winning the 7 of coins (sette bello); avoid giving away sweeps; leave at least 11 on the table when you cannot sweep to make it harder for the next player.\n\nEstablish anchors (e.g. a rank only your side can match) to set up whirlwinds; lead or leave cards of ranks you hold two or more of; track paired vs unpaired cards to plan the last trick.\n\nPair and unpair sevens to control the prime; coordinate with partner (e.g. play same rank after partner to consolidate); leave totals that the next player cannot match to force a card to the table for your side to capture.',
